write(u,'一张一张先分好',['Read classifier repetition as distribution or sequence','Distinguish the total from each person’s allocation','Keep a payment or offer separate from completion'],[
('丰富','rich; plentiful; varied','phong phú','adjective','内容丰富，也先选一段。','The content is varied; still choose one passage first.'),('富','rich; wealthy','giàu','adjective','富不富不是我们分纸的标准。','Wealth is not our criterion for distributing paper.'),('缺','to lack; be short of','thiếu','verb','还缺两张纸。','Two sheets are still missing.'),('缺少','to lack; be short of','thiếu','verb','缺少信息，先问清楚。','If information is missing, clarify it first.'),('数量','quantity; number','số lượng','noun','数量是六张，不是每人六张。','The quantity is six sheets, not six per person.'),('满足','to satisfy; meet','đáp ứng; thỏa mãn','verb','六张可以满足六个人的需要。','Six sheets can meet six people’s need.'),('分别','separately; respectively','riêng; lần lượt','adverb','两组分别拿三张。','The two groups each take three sheets.'),('方式','way; method','cách thức','noun','分的方式是一人一张。','The distribution method is one sheet per person.'),('配','to match; allocate; equip','phối; cấp','verb','给每组配两支笔。','Equip each group with two pens.'),('配合','to cooperate; coordinate','phối hợp','verb','你递纸，我配合记数量。','You pass the sheets; I cooperate by recording quantities.'),('齐','complete; all present; even','đủ; đều','adjective','纸齐了，人数还没确认。','The sheets are all present; attendance is still unconfirmed.'),('整','whole; entire','toàn; nguyên','adjective','整本书不是只看标题。','The whole book means more than reading the title.'),('整个','the whole; entire','toàn bộ','adjective','整个小组有六个人。','The whole group has six people.'),('整体','whole; overall entity','tổng thể','noun','看整体，也看每个人的需要。','Consider the whole and each individual’s needs.'),('全面','comprehensive; all-round','toàn diện','adjective','全面检查，不是只数纸。','A comprehensive check does not count only paper.'),('人群','crowd; group of people','đám đông','noun','人群在门外，名单还要核对。','The crowd is outside; the list still needs checking.'),('双方','both parties; both sides','hai bên','noun','双方同意以后再安排。','Arrange it once both parties agree.'),('人民币','renminbi; Chinese currency','nhân dân tệ','noun','费用用人民币写。','The fee is stated in renminbi.'),('付','to pay; give','trả','verb','我还没付，只是问价钱。','I have not paid; I only asked the price.'),('支付','to pay; make a payment','thanh toán','verb','支付以后要看记录。','Check the record after payment.'),('交费','to pay a fee','nộp phí','verb','交费的时间还没定。','The fee-payment time is not settled.'),('收费','to charge a fee','thu phí','verb','这个活动不收费。','This activity does not charge a fee.')],
[grammar(u,'三11','量词重叠：个个 / 本本 / 张张等','Read distribution within a stated set',
'这六张纸张张都有名字 means each of these six sheets bears a name; it does not prove every sheet anywhere is named. 本本都读过 ranges over the books just mentioned. Not every classifier repeats equally naturally in all contexts; use 个个/本本/张张 with a clear noun or preceding set. Compare 每张 rather than invent a new total from repetition.',[('这六张纸，张张都有名字。','Each of these six sheets bears a name.'),('这些书，本本都读过。','Each of these books has been read.'),('组里的朋友个个都来了。','Every friend in the group came.')],('张张有名字，所以世界上所有纸都有名字。','这六张纸张张有名字，只说这六张。','The distributive scope remains the stated set.')),
grammar(u,'三33','数词 + 量词重复：一个一个 / 一张一张','Read sequential handling and context-dependent distribution',
'一张一张递 describes passing sheets one at a time. 两张两张发 distributes or handles two at a time; with six sheets this means three batches, not two total sheets. 一人一张 states individual allocation and has a different pattern. Repetition alone does not establish the overall quantity or completion.',[('把六张纸一张一张递过来。','Pass the six sheets over one at a time.'),('两张两张发，一共六张。','Distribute them two at a time, six in total.'),('一人一张，六个人要六张。','One sheet per person: six people need six sheets.')],('两张两张发，所以一共只有两张。','两张两张发是方式，总数还要看说明。','Batch size is not total quantity.'))],
text(u,'d','Six sheets, two groups','Track total, group and person quantities.',[
('整个小组六个人，现在有几张纸？','There are six in the whole group; how many sheets are here?'),('四张，还缺两张。','Four; two are still missing.'),('我再拿两张，六张就齐了。','I will get two more, making all six present.'),('两组分别拿三张，一人一张。','The two groups each take three, one per person.'),('我一张一张递，你配合记数量。','I pass one at a time; help record the quantity.'),('这六张，张张都有名字。活动收费吗？','Each of these six has a name. Does the event charge a fee?'),('不收费，人民币也不用付。','No charge and no renminbi payment needed.'),('好，纸齐不等于人都到了，最后核对名单。','Okay; all sheets present does not mean all people arrived. Check the list last.')],
[('mainidea','What quantities are kept distinct?',['Total sheets, group share and individual share','Only currency amounts','Every sheet in the world'],0),('detail','How many sheets does each group take?',['Three','Six','Two'],0),('inference','Does having six sheets prove six people arrived?',['No','Yes','Only if names are written'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','An allocation note','Follow sequence without confusing it with a total.',[
('整个小组六个人，原来四张纸，再拿两张，共六张。','The group has six people; four sheets plus two more makes six.'),('两组分别拿三张，每个人一张，数量不能混。','Each of two groups takes three, one per person; do not confuse the quantities.'),('一张一张递说方式，不是说只有一张。','Passing one at a time states a method, not a total of one.'),('这六张纸张张都有名字，只说这六张。','Each of these six sheets has a name; only these six are described.'),('内容丰富，也不用一次读完整本书。','Varied content does not require reading the whole book in one sitting.'),('两组配合可以满足需要，缺少信息就再问。','The two groups can cooperate to meet the need; ask again if information is missing.'),('双方说活动不收费，不需要交费和支付。','Both parties say the event is free; no fee or payment is needed.'),('全面看整体，也看个人；美好的安排要把名单核对齐。','Consider the whole and each individual; a good arrangement checks the full list.')],
[('mainidea','What distinction does the note teach?',['Allocation method versus total and scope','A mandatory paid registration','A universal quantity of three'],0),('detail','How many sheets were originally present?',['Four','Six','Two'],0),('inference','Does one-at-a-time mean one sheet in total?',['No','Yes','Only at a free event'],0)],[(1,'三张'),(6,'收费')]),
text(u,'media','The single-sheet universe','Read an original scene about a tiny quantity error.',[
('一张一张递，那一共就是一张？','Pass one at a time, so there is just one in total?'),('你把整个小组放进一张纸了。','You put the whole group inside one sheet.'),('那六张，两组分别三张。','Then six sheets, three for each of two groups.'),('对，一人一张，张张有名字。','Yes, one per person, each with a name.'),('纸齐了，人还要数。','The sheets are all here; we still count people.'),('这次全面了一点儿。','A little more comprehensive this time.')],
[('inference','What error is repaired?',['Treating a handling unit as the total','Charging an imaginary fee','Claiming the event is free'],0)],drama=True),
dict(tf=[('数量','六个人，一人一张，共六张。','Six people, one per person, six sheets total.','The total is six.',True,'The allocation multiplies to six.'),('付','活动不收费，不用付。','The event is free; no payment is needed.','A payment is required.',False,'Both claims deny a charge.')],reply=[('缺','四张纸，六个人，一人一张，缺多少？','Four sheets for six people, one each; how many missing?',['缺两张。','缺六张。','不缺，四等于六。'],0,'Six minus four is two.'),('齐','纸都齐了，人一定都到了吗？','All sheets are here; did all people necessarily arrive?',['不一定，要核对名单。','一定，纸就是人。','只看人民币就行。'],0,'Inventory and attendance differ.')],fill=[('方式','一张一张递，说的是方式。','Passing one at a time describes the method.'),('收费','活动不收费。','The event is free.')],match=[('分别',[('两组分别三张。','Three sheets per group for two groups.'),('每人一张。','One sheet per person.'),('一共六张。','Six sheets in total.')]),('整体',[('这六张张张有名字。','Each of these six sheets has a name.'),('两张两张发。','Distribute two at a time.'),('还缺两张。','Two more sheets are needed.')])]),
[('Check the total','六个人一人一张，一共六张，对吗？','Six people with one each: six total, right?','Confirm people, unit and total.'),('Keep attendance separate','纸齐了，还要核对人。','The sheets are all present; people still need checking.','Do not infer attendance from inventory.')],
[('四张够六个人吗？','Are four sheets enough for six people?','Use one-per-person rule',['还缺两张。']),('两组怎么分？','How do the two groups share them?','State group allocation',['分别三张。'])],
'Native check: classifier AA naturalness and bounded scope, one-at-a-time versus per-person patterns, 配/配合 collocations, 富 adjective and nominal 整/整体. The original verse is spoken course writing, not borrowed lyrics. Native review pending.')

u='s3-u08'
write(u,'唱得清楚比唱得快重要',['Compare manner and quantity with the right structure','Read 不比 without inventing a strict reverse comparison','Separate enthusiastic delivery from accurate spoken tones'],[
('比较','relatively; compare','tương đối; so sánh','adverb','这一段比较容易。','This passage is relatively easy.'),('更加','even more','càng hơn','adverb','这次说得更加清楚。','This time the speech is even clearer.'),('相当','quite; fairly; equivalent','khá; tương đương','adverb','这一段相当难，先慢慢读。','This passage is quite difficult; read it slowly first.'),('强','strong','mạnh','adjective','声音强，不一定意思清楚。','A strong voice does not guarantee clear meaning.'),('强大','powerful; strong','hùng mạnh; mạnh mẽ','adjective','团队强大，也要听每个人。','A strong team still needs to hear each person.'),('强调','to emphasize','nhấn mạnh','verb','强调意思，不是乱改声调。','Emphasize the meaning rather than randomly changing tones.'),('强烈','intense; strong','mạnh mẽ','adjective','她有强烈的愿望，还要慢慢练。','She has a strong wish and still needs gradual practice.'),('进一步','further; one step further','hơn nữa; bước tiếp','adverb','下一次进一步改进。','Make further improvements next time.'),('进步','progress; to improve','tiến bộ','noun','进步要看记录，不靠乱夸。','Progress depends on records, not exaggerated praise.'),('改进','to improve; make better','cải tiến','verb','先改进不清楚的地方。','Improve the unclear parts first.'),('技术','technique; technology','kỹ thuật','noun','技术要练，不只看舞台。','Technique needs practice, not just watching a stage.'),('艺术','art','nghệ thuật','noun','艺术表演和考试任务不同。','Artistic performance and exam tasks differ.'),('舞台','stage','sân khấu','noun','舞台上大声，练习时先清楚。','Be loud on stage; in practice, clarity comes first.'),('演唱','to sing; perform singing','biểu diễn ca hát','verb','今天演唱的是原创短句。','Today’s singing performance uses original short lines.'),('演唱会','concert','buổi hòa nhạc','noun','演唱会时间还没确认。','The concert time is unconfirmed.'),('演出','performance; to perform','biểu diễn','noun','演出结束，不等于练习结束。','The performance ending does not mean practice ends.'),('演员','actor; performer','diễn viên','noun','演员演的是角色，不是自己的全部生活。','Actors perform roles, not their entire lives.'),('歌手','singer','ca sĩ','noun','喜欢歌手，也要听懂歌词的意思。','Liking a singer still calls for understanding the words.'),('歌声','singing voice; sound of singing','tiếng hát','noun','歌声很强，意思还要看文字。','The singing is strong; check the words for the meaning.'),('歌迷','music fan; singer’s fan','người hâm mộ ca sĩ','noun','歌迷也可以先练清楚的一句。','A music fan can start by practising one clear sentence.'),('乐队','band; musical ensemble','ban nhạc','noun','乐队今天还没来。','The band has not arrived today.'),('精彩','wonderful; excellent','đặc sắc','adjective','精彩的表演，不是所有声调都教过了。','An excellent performance does not mean every tone has been taught.')],
[grammar(u,'三12','比较 / 更加 / 还 / 相当：程度','Distinguish an explicit comparison from a degree modifier',
'比较清楚 may mean relatively clear without naming a comparator; 比昨天清楚 is explicit. 更加清楚 builds on a prior degree. 还 can mean even more in 他比我还快, distinct from continuing 还在练. 相当难 means quite difficult here, not a claim two objects are equivalent. Use context, and do not infer a numeric gain.',[('这一段比较容易。','This passage is relatively easy.'),('这次更加清楚。','This time it is even clearer.'),('他比我还快，但我还在练。','He is even faster than me, but I am still practising.')],('比较清楚就是一定比所有人清楚。','比较清楚不一定说了比较对象。','A relative degree word does not identify every comparator.')),
grammar(u,'三58','A比B说得清楚 / A不比B快 / 比B多读一遍','Compare delivery and quantified differences',
'她比我说得清楚 and 她说得比我清楚 compare manner. A不比B快 denies A being faster, allowing equality or slower, rather than proving B is strictly faster. 我比她多读一遍 states one extra repetition; 我比她早到十分钟 states a time difference. 不如 often implies inferiority and differs from 不比. Preserve the dimension and stated amount.',[('她说得比我清楚。','She speaks more clearly than I do.'),('我不比她快，可能一样快。','I am not faster than her; we may be equally fast.'),('我比她多读一遍。','I read it one more time than she did.')],('我不比她快，所以她一定更快。','我不比她快，可能一样快，也可能更慢。','Negating faster allows equality; it does not force strict reversal.'))],
text(u,'d','Clarity before speed','Find which dimension the practice comparison actually measures.',[
('你这一段比较清楚，比昨天怎么样？','This passage is relatively clear; how does it compare with yesterday?'),('今天说得比昨天清楚，但不比你快。','Today I speak more clearly than yesterday, but not faster than you.'),('不比我快，就是一定比我慢吗？','Not faster than me means certainly slower than me?'),('不是，可能一样快。速度没有具体记录。','No, possibly equally fast. There is no actual speed record.'),('你读了几遍？','How many times did you read it?'),('三遍，你两遍，我比你多读一遍。','Three; you read twice, so I read once more.'),('今天先练清楚，演唱时再有舞台的感觉。','Practise clarity first today; add stage energy when singing.'),('好，强调意思，不乱改声调。','Okay, emphasize meaning without arbitrarily changing tones.')],
[('mainidea','What comes first in practice?',['Clarity','A claim of exact speed','A concert ticket'],0),('detail','How many extra readings did the speaker do?',['One','Two','Three'],0),('inference','Does not faster prove strictly slower?',['No','Yes','Only on stage'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','A karaoke practice note','Read an original spoken note rather than infer tone accuracy from a song.',[
('今天练原创短句，先说清楚，再演唱。','Today practise original short lines: speak clearly before singing.'),('三遍比两遍多一遍，只说次数，不说谁更有才能。','Three repetitions is one more than two; that compares counts, not talent.'),('说得比昨天清楚是进步方向，没有准确分数。','Clearer speech than yesterday indicates a direction of progress, not an exact score.'),('不比朋友快可以一样快，不能自动写成更慢。','Not faster than a friend may be equally fast; do not automatically report slower.'),('艺术表演会改变声音，学习声调要听清楚的说话。','Artistic performance may alter the voice; learn tones from clear speech.'),('舞台也能演话剧，不是所有演员都是歌手。','A stage can host spoken drama too; not every performer is a singer.'),('技术可以进一步改进，乐队没来时也先读文字。','Technique can improve further; while the band is absent, read the words first.'),('演出精彩不等于任务全完成，记录要具体。','An excellent performance does not finish every task; keep records specific.')],
[('mainidea','What should practice records distinguish?',['Counts, clarity, speed and performance','One universal perfect score','Every actor being a singer'],0),('detail','What is three readings compared with two?',['One more','Two more','Three more'],0),('inference','Does a good performance certify all spoken tones?',['No','Yes','Only without a band'],0)],[(0,'演唱'),(2,'进步')]),
text(u,'media','One more reading, not a trophy','Read an original verse about a modest practice record.',[
('三遍比两遍，多了一遍。','Three readings versus two: one extra.'),('今天比昨天，清楚一点。','Today versus yesterday: a little clearer.'),('不比你快，也许一样。','Not faster than you; perhaps equal.'),('声音可以强，声调别乱。','The voice may be strong; do not jumble the tones.'),('舞台等一等，文字先看。','The stage can wait; read the words first.'),('精彩归精彩，记录不夸。','Wonderful is wonderful; the record does not exaggerate.')],
[('inference','What does the verse avoid?',['Claiming an unsupported perfect score','Mentioning repetition counts','Allowing equal speed'],0)]),
dict(tf=[('比较','不比你快，可能一样快。','Not faster than you; possibly equally fast.','Equality remains possible.',True,'不比 permits equality.'),('进步','三遍比两遍多一遍。','Three repetitions is one more than two.','There are two extra readings.',False,'The difference is one.')],reply=[('强调','声音更强就一定声调更准吗？','Does a stronger voice guarantee more accurate tones?',['不一定，要听清楚的说话。','一定，强就是所有分数。','舞台就是两遍。'],0,'Power does not establish tone accuracy.'),('乐队','乐队还没来，先做什么？','The band has not arrived; what first?',['先读文字，练清楚。','把三遍说成两遍。','不用问演唱会时间。'],0,'Follow the stated practice plan.')],fill=[('更加','今天说得更加清楚。','Today the speech is even clearer.'),('舞台','舞台也能演话剧。','The stage can also host spoken drama.')],match=[('技术',[('说得比昨天清楚。','Speak more clearly than yesterday.'),('比她多读一遍。','Read one more time than her.'),('不比她快。','Not faster than her.')]),('相当',[('相当难。','Quite difficult.'),('比较容易。','Relatively easy.'),('更加清楚。','Even clearer.')])]),
[('Report a limited comparison','今天比昨天清楚，速度还没记录。','Clearer than yesterday; speed is not yet recorded.','Keep dimensions distinct.'),('Allow equality','不比你快，也可能一样快。','Not faster than you; possibly equally fast.','Do not reverse the comparison automatically.')],
[('三遍比两遍多几遍？','How many more is three than two?','State the exact difference',['多一遍。']),('现在先练什么？','What should we practise first?','Prioritize clear speech',['先说清楚。'])],
'Native check: 比较 versus 比, degree 还 versus continuing 还, 相当 degree use, manner comparison word order, 不比 versus 不如, quantified 比 differences and spoken-versus-sung tone notes. All verse lines are original; no copyrighted lyric or real singer identity. Native review pending.')

